# Quick Start Guide - Authentication Tests

## 🚀 Get Started in 3 Steps

### Step 1: Install Dependencies
```bash
cd backend
npm install
```

### Step 2: Run Tests
```bash
npm test
```

### Step 3: Watch Tests (Development)
```bash
npm run test:watch
```

