## 📋 What Gets Tested

### Signup Endpoint (`POST /api/auth/signup`)
- ✅ Creates new user with email, password, and name
- ✅ Returns JWT token
- ✅ Validates required fields
- ✅ Validates password length (min 8 characters)

### Login Endpoint (`POST /api/auth/login`)
- ✅ Authenticates with correct credentials
- ✅ Returns JWT token
- ✅ Rejects non-existent user
- ✅ Rejects incorrect password

## 🔧 Requirements

- **Node.js**: >= 18.0.0
- **RAM**: 2GB minimum (for MongoDB Memory Server)
- **Disk**: 500MB free (MongoDB Memory Server binary)

